An lcov report without function records is refused, with the way to make one.

```
$ jci-coverage complexity --file coverage/report.lcov
? 1
Error: coverage/report.lcov is not an lcov report to use

Caused by:
    the lcov report has no function records (`FN:` lines); `complexity` matches functions to the source with them. `cargo llvm-cov --lcov` writes them; lcov from another tool works if it has them and names the functions as Rust paths (`crate::module::function`)

```
